{"t": 1794113848.0720778, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_push_files", "args": {"branch": "eng-91", "files": [{"content": "\"\"\"Helpers for API response headers.\"\"\"\n\nDEPRECATION_LINK = '<https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"'\n\n\ndef deprecation_headers(sunset_date: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Return the standard deprecation headers for a deprecated endpoint.\n\n    Per the API guidelines (Deprecation section), deprecated endpoints must\n    send:\n\n    * ``Deprecation: true``\n    * ``Sunset: <HTTP-date>``\n    * ``Link: <https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"``\n\n    ``sunset_date`` is the value for the ``Sunset`` header and must already be\n    formatted as an HTTP-date (RFC 7231), e.g.\n    ``\"Wed, 21 Oct 2015 07:28:00 GMT\"``.\n    \"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"Deprecation\": \"true\",\n        \"Sunset\": sunset_date,\n        \"Link\": DEPRECATION_LINK,\n    }\n", "path": "api/headers.py"}], "message": "ENG-91: Add deprecation headers for v1 endpoints", "owner": "acme", "repo": "public-api"}, "ok": true}
{"t": 1794113850.597126, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_create_pull_request", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "Implements `api.headers.deprecation_headers(sunset_date)` per ENG-91.\n\nReturns the deprecation headers specified in the Notion \"API guidelines\" page (Deprecation section):\n\n- `Deprecation: true`\n- `Sunset: <HTTP-date>` (value supplied by the caller via `sunset_date`)\n- `Link: <https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"`\n", "head": "eng-91", "owner": "acme", "repo": "public-api", "title": "ENG-91: Add deprecation headers to v1 endpoints"}, "ok": true}
